# Files carried in the sdist beyond what setuptools includes by default.
# UPGRADING.md is the cumulative upgrade guide the README links: it has to
# be reachable from an installed artefact, not only from a GitHub blob,
# because the consumer who most needs it is the one reading what they have
# already downloaded.
include UPGRADING.md
include CHANGELOG.md
include LICENSE
include SECURITY.md
